## Claude + Codex Collaboration Mode
For thesis writing tasks: Claude负责(架构设计、需求分析、文档撰写、逻辑审查) / Codex负责(代码实现、表结构生成、ER图绘制、技术细节) / Use command: `OMX_TEAM_WORKER_CLI_MAP='claude,codex' omx team 2:executor "<task>"`
